{#-
  Reminds an operator that the accessibility statement is due its yearly
  review. Sent by the `accessibility-reminder` admin action, which the
  accessibility-review workflow runs each Monday once the review is
  eleven months old. Context:
    reviewed       when the statement was last reviewed, in words
    due_by         when the next review is due, in words
    statement_url  where the statement is published
-#}
{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% import "_components.html.j2" as c with context %}
{% block subject %}Accessibility statement review due by {{ due_by }}{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}It was last reviewed on {{ reviewed }}.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{{ c.heading("Accessibility statement *review*") }}
{{ c.paragraph("The accessibility statement is due its yearly review by " ~ due_by ~ ". It was last reviewed on " ~ reviewed ~ ".") }}
{{ c.paragraph("The Public Sector Bodies Accessibility Regulations 2018 require the statement to be reviewed at least once a year, and NHS organisations that buy Quill are bound by them.") }}
{{ c.button("Read the statement", statement_url) }}
{{ c.subheading("To review it") }}
{{ c.paragraph("1. Read the statement against the testing log, docs/docs/frontend/accessibility/testing-log.md. Is everything it says still true?") }}
{{ c.paragraph("2. Update the known issues: remove anything fixed, and add anything the testing log or users have found since.") }}
{{ c.paragraph("3. Check the compliance status. Only move beyond \"partially compliant\" if testing by people supports it.") }}
{{ c.paragraph("4. Check that info@quill-medical.com, the contact the statement gives, is still read.") }}
{{ c.paragraph("5. Move the REVIEWED date in frontend/public_pages/src/pages/accessibility-statement.tsx to today, and deploy the public site. That resets these reminders.") }}
{{ c.small("This reminder is sent every Monday until the date is moved.") }}
{% endblock %}
{% block reason %}You are receiving this because this address is set to be reminded of Quill's accessibility statement review.{% endblock %}

{% block text %}
The accessibility statement is due its yearly review by {{ due_by }}. It was last reviewed on {{ reviewed }}.

The Public Sector Bodies Accessibility Regulations 2018 require the statement to be reviewed at least once a year, and NHS organisations that buy Quill are bound by them.

The statement: {{ statement_url }}

To review it:

1. Read the statement against the testing log (docs/docs/frontend/accessibility/testing-log.md). Is everything it says still true?
2. Update the known issues: remove anything fixed, and add anything the testing log or users have found since.
3. Check the compliance status. Only move beyond "partially compliant" if testing by people supports it.
4. Check that info@quill-medical.com, the contact the statement gives, is still read.
5. Move the REVIEWED date in frontend/public_pages/src/pages/accessibility-statement.tsx to today, and deploy the public site. That resets these reminders.

This reminder is sent every Monday until the date is moved, by the accessibility-review workflow.
{% endblock %}
